# mojo_smoke: named reporting for a Mojo smoke suite.
#
#   report    SmokeCase and SmokeReport: run every case, name each verdict as
#             it is recorded, and keep counting after a failure.
#   claims    require_claim and require_contract: a test declares the ledger
#             claim or the contract it guards, and prints a receipt line.
#
# This is test scaffolding. It computes nothing mathematical and certifies
# nothing; it only reports what the cases it is handed returned.
